---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { goodwellness as center } from '../../data/goodwellness';
---
<BaseLayout section="goodwellness" title="About">
  <PageHeader title="About the center" description={`${center.fullName} · ${center.koreanName}`} />
  <section class="section"><div class="container-page center-reading">
    <section><h2>From laboratory to community</h2><p>Yonsei RoboGym is the world’s first community-based robot rehabilitation gym. It brings advanced rehabilitation robotics beyond the laboratory and hospital into everyday community care.</p><p>With continuing support and collaboration from Wonju City, the center connects rehabilitation, exercise, and wellness with practical clinical experience.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Rehabilitation across the life span</h2><p>The center serves children, adults, older adults, and people with disabilities, including people with neurological and musculoskeletal conditions.</p><ul class="center-audiences"><li>Children</li><li>Adults</li><li>Older adults</li></ul></section>
    <section><h2>Community participation</h2><p>In 2023, approximately 10,000 people annually received rehabilitation, exercise, and wellness services through the center.</p><p lang="ko">연세굿웰니스센터는 원주시의 지원과 협력을 바탕으로 소아부터 성인, 노인까지 전 생애주기에 걸친 지역사회 로봇재활 및 운동 서비스를 제공합니다.</p></section>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
